        {
            "_id": "JepvvuCmnowWfJ5S",
            "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp",
            "name": "All My Favorite Things!",
            "sort": 600000,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "action"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": 2
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>The gerbie overloads the mind of a creature within 100 feet with thoughts of sunny days, of cute fauna and beautiful flora, of frolicking in fields, and of many other pleasant things. The creature takes @Damage[4d6[mental]] damage and must attempt a @Check[will|dc:21] save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes half damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage and becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stupefied]{Stupefied 1} for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes double damage and becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stunned]{Stunned 1} and stupefied 1 for 1 round.</p>"
                },
                "publication": {
