                    "value": null
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>30 feet. When a creature enters or starts its turn in the gerbie's friendship aura, it attempts a @Check[will|dc:21] save.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected and becomes temporarily immune to this gerbie's friendship aura for 24 hours.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is unable to take hostile actions toward the gerbie until it leaves the aura or until the gerbie targets it with a hostile action.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is unable to take hostile actions toward anyone in the friendship aura until it leaves the aura.</p>"
                },
