        {
            "_id": "BG2sUem0ubxW5DyO",
            "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp",
            "name": "Make it All Better",
            "sort": 900000,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "action"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": 1
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p><strong>Effect</strong> The gerbie touches a creature and causes it to forget something, suppressing all memory of a particular topic, detailed in 50 words or fewer. If the creature is unwilling, it can attempt a @Check[will|dc:21] save to negate the effect. A creature with a memory altered this way can attempt a @Check[will|dc:21] save to regain the original memory each morning.</p>"
                },
